ode> 冻结冻结/解冻</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cIlldT8W\"><code>SHARED_CANCEL_RECHARGE</code> 共享钱包充值撤销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-z2cCJqMU\"><code>SHARED_FROZEN_REFUND</code> 共享钱包退款</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FNZ5Us1T\"><code>SHARED_RECHARGE</code> 共享钱包充值</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-d8h80jII\"><code>TRANSFER</code> 转账</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PRInI8vg\"><code>TRANSFER_IN</code> 转入</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nWgQxjTt\"><code>TRANSFER_OUT</code> 转出</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mB81fPVQ\"><code>RISK_CONTROL_FREEZE</code> 风控冻结/解冻</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">payee_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jEwkLYGU\">收款账户类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-hcdSKYo2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TIYJ4kiM\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理商账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5fcgI4Rj\"><code>SHARED_WALLET</code> 共享钱包账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">payee</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pbGKoUBm\">收款账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">payee_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tnUbJDAc\">收款账户名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section